# A space before the colon is valid YAML and is not the spelling the parser
# reads, so it refuses instead of quietly offering an exclusive task.
run available
exit 3
file tasks/M2-01.md
	---
	id: M2-01
	depends_on: []
	exclusive : yes
	---
stderr
	tasks.sh: tasks/M2-01.md: frontmatter key must be written exactly "exclusive:", found: exclusive : yes
